                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] Very promising little MMO RTS game, but already abandoned - AVOID [/h1]\n\nPositives:\n+ Great theme and atmosphere of the game\n+ Game mechanics are decent and taken from games like Supreme Commander/Ashes of The Singularity\n+ Graphics look decent \n+ Nice soundtrack (of course there could be more tunes)\n\nNegatives:\n- No more updates are expected\n- Not enough variety of units and factions are all the same\n- No normal single player campaign and skirmish is also very shallow at the moment (no options to set more than 1 opponent for example)\n- Some bugs and other minor glitches, but they are expected in early access Game",
